{
    "name": "E2E MCPTools - gateway tool port",
    "description": "MCPGateway announces its webhook on the 'out' port; the flow calls two tools through it (EchoTool with a model-defined parameter, GreetTool with a static value) exactly the way an MCP client would, and asserts the component output that comes back. A third call passes a 'value' argument to GreetTool and asserts the static value still wins — a caller must not override a literal configured on the tool.",
