    "notes": {
        "327c267a-c5c4-4ef6-b731-1955dba44333": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 816,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Tool names are derived from component IDs\n\nThe three `Call …Tool` HTTP components post a literal tool name to the gateway webhook:\n\n- `pM5edMztbgussb84FReaoB_EchoTool` → EchoTool (`c08d43af-…`)\n- `5K5ZxsRuVJshv8u9dMYXb3_GreetTool` → GreetTool (`26689cfd-…`)\n\n`mcptools/tool.js buildToolName()` builds those as `shortUuid(componentId)_<component label>`, so **copying a tool component, changing its label or re-creating it in the designer changes its tool name** and the call comes back `404 Unknown tool`. Recompute with `require('short-uuid')().fromUUID(componentId)` and update the request bodies.\n\nNo tenant data is needed and nothing is created outside Appmixer, so there is nothing to clean up."
        }
    }
